def abstracts(m):
    chinese = ("针对人工智能编程基础课程中从数据分析到模型部署的综合训练需求，设计了一套基于TensorFlow的鸢尾花分类系统。系统以UCI公开数据的花萼长度、花萼宽度、花瓣长度和花瓣宽度为输入，对三个品种进行识别。150条记录按类别分层划分为90条训练数据、30条验证数据和30条测试数据，标准化参数仅由训练集估计，以降低数据泄漏风险。网络采用两个隐藏层，结构为4—16—8—3，结合ReLU、Softmax、交叉熵和Adam完成学习，并依据验证损失早停及恢复权重。独立测试中正确分类28条，准确率为93.33%，宏平均F1为0.9333，与同条件逻辑回归基线持平。进一步利用消融实验、不同初始化种子和逐条误判分析讨论小样本评价的波动，以及高Softmax分数仍可能对应错误预测的问题。系统同时提供输入合法性检查、模型保存、命令行预测、图表生成和自动化检查，并将源代码、数据来源、依赖版本及实验工件纳入版本管理。结果说明，小型神经网络可以支持可复现的教学分类流程，但现有实验尚不能证明其优于简单模型，也不能外推为野外图像识别能力。资源与可持续发展分析强调适度计算、来源署名和如实说明使用边界。")
    english = ("A TensorFlow classification system was developed to connect data analysis, neural network training, evaluation, and reproducible delivery in an introductory artificial intelligence programming course. The public UCI Iris dataset provides four measurements in centimeters for three species. Its 150 observations were split into 90 training, 30 validation, and 30 test samples using stratification. Standardization statistics were estimated from the training subset only. A multilayer perceptron with a 4-16-8-3 architecture and 243 trainable parameters was optimized using Adam and sparse categorical cross-entropy. Validation-loss early stopping restored the selected weights. The frozen model correctly classified 28 of 30 test observations, yielding 93.33% accuracy and a macro F1 score of 0.9333, equal to the logistic regression baseline under the same split. Validation-only ablations and initialization-seed experiments were used to examine the sensitivity of the learning procedure. Two misclassified test cases demonstrate that a high softmax score does not guarantee a correct prediction. The implementation includes measurement validation, saved preprocessing statistics, command-line inference, experiment records, figures, and automated checks. Source code, dataset attribution, environment specifications, model artifacts, and the report are distributed through version control. The results support a reproducible educational workflow rather than a claim that a deeper model is always preferable. Limited sample size, uncalibrated scores, and the absence of external field data restrict generalization. Resource analysis emphasizes appropriately sized CPU computation and avoids unsupported energy or carbon-reduction estimates.")
    return chinese, english
